<view class="manage-page">
  <view class="section shared-preview" wx:if="{{previewLoading || remoteChanges.length}}"><view class="title">共享成员的最新修改</view><view class="hint" wx:if="{{previewLoading}}">正在检查云端变化…</view><block wx:else><view class="hint">逐条选择要应用的内容；未选择的修改会继续保留在云端。</view><view class="remote-change {{item.selected ? 'selected' : ''}}" wx:for="{{remoteChanges}}" wx:key="recordId" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="toggleRemoteChange"><view class="change-check">{{item.selected ? '✓' : ''}}</view><view class="change-main"><text>{{item.actor}}{{item.role ? ' · ' + item.role : ''}}</text><view>{{item.typeText}}了{{item.label}}记录</view><view class="change-compare" wx:if="{{item.type === 'updated'}}"><text>本机：{{item.localText}}</text><text>云端：{{item.remoteText}}</text></view></view><text>{{item.timeText}}</text></view><button class="apply-selected" loading="{{syncing}}" bindtap="applySelectedChanges">应用选中的修改</button></block></view>
  <view class="section"><view class="title">数据保存状态</view><view class="row"><view>{{syncText}}<text wx:if="{{pendingCount}}"> · {{pendingCount}} 项待处理</text></view><button size="mini" loading="{{syncing}}" disabled="{{demo || syncing}}" bindtap="retrySync">重新同步</button></view><view class="hint">{{syncDetail}}</view><view class="conflict-tip" wx:if="{{syncText === '发现记录冲突'}}">云端不会直接覆盖其他成员的新版本。<button size="mini" bindtap="useCloudVersion">使用云端最新版本</button></view><view class="row" wx:if="{{showDemoSwitch}}"><text>演示数据</text><switch checked="{{demo}}" bindchange="switchMode" color="#ef835c" /></view><view class="hint" wx:if="{{showDemoSwitch}}">演示记录和正式记录分开保存。</view></view>
  <view class="section"><view class="title">护理通知</view><view class="hint">{{reminderMessage}}</view><block wx:if="{{reminderReady}}"><picker mode="time" value="{{reminderTime}}" bindchange="onReminderTime"><view class="row">通知时间（北京时间）<text>{{reminderTime}} ›</text></view></picker><view class="row" wx:for="{{careItems}}" wx:key="key"><view>{{item.label}}<view class="hint">{{item.date}}</view></view><button size="mini" disabled="{{reminderBusy || item.date === '未设置'}}" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="subscribeCare">订阅一次</button></view></block><view class="row" wx:for="{{reminderJobs}}" wx:key="_id"><view>{{item.label}} · {{item.date}} {{item.time}}<view class="hint">{{item.statusText}}</view></view><button wx:if="{{item.status === 'pending'}}" size="mini" data-id="{{item._id}}" bindtap="pauseReminder">暂停</button></view></view>
  <view class="section"><view class="title">生成就诊资料</view><view class="hint">选择时间范围，整理饮食、排便、运动、护理用药和体重，方便就诊时出示。</view><view class="row"><picker mode="date" value="{{start}}" end="{{end}}" bindchange="onStart">{{start}} ›</picker><text>至</text><picker mode="date" value="{{end}}" start="{{start}}" end="{{today}}" bindchange="onEnd">{{end}} ›</picker></view><view class="row"><text>隐藏宠物昵称和性别</text><switch checked="{{redact}}" bindchange="onRedact" color="#ef835c" /></view><button bindtap="generateSummary">生成摘要</button><block wx:if="{{summaryText}}"><scroll-view class="summary-preview" scroll-y><text selectable>{{summaryText}}</text></scroll-view><view class="row"><button size="mini" bindtap="copySummary">复制文本</button><button size="mini" bindtap="shareSummary">分享文件</button></view></block></view>
</view>
